{"availability":"available","full":"SeekStorm/SeekStorm","name":"SeekStorm","description":"SeekStorm: vector & lexical search - in-process library & multi-tenancy server, in Rust.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":1916,"forks":71,"created":"2024-02-27T12:55:08Z","updated":"2026-10-13T07:56:22Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://seekstorm.com","topics":["ai-search","bm25","dense-retrieval","enterprise-search","faceting","full-text-search","geosearch","hybrid-search","lexical-search","neural-search","realtime","search","search-engine","search-server","search-service","semantic-search","sparse-retrieval","vector-database","vector-search","vector-search-engine"],"demo":"https://deephn.org/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T12:58:18.471Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T12:58:18.471Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T12:58:18.471Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T23:11:40.323Z","stars":1918,"forks":71},{"at":"2026-10-15T12:58:18.471Z","stars":1916,"forks":71}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["SeekStorm: sub-millisecond, native vector & lexical search - in-process library & multi-tenancy server, in Rust.","Development started in 2015, in production since 2020. SeekStorm is open source licensed under the Apache License 2.0","Twin-core native vector & keyword search Two separate, first-class, native index architectures for vector search and keyword search under one roof. A query planner with 8 dedicated QueryModes and FusionTypes automatically decide how to combine the results for maximum query understanding."],"features":["Search speed might be good enough for a single search. Below 10 ms people can't tell latency anymore. Search latency might be small compared to internet network latency.","But search engine performance still matters when used in a server or service for many concurrent users and requests for maximum scaling, throughput, low processor load, and cost.","With performant search technology, you can serve many concurrent users at low latency with fewer servers, less cost, less energy consumption, and a lower carbon footprint.","It also ensures low latency even for complex and challenging queries: instant search, fuzzy search, faceted search, and union/intersection/phrase of very frequent terms.","Local search performance matters, e.g. when many local queries are spawned for reranking, fallback/refinement queries, fuzzy search, data mining or RAG befor the response is transferred back over the network."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SeekStorm/SeekStorm/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c2290bce42a9150bbb02893de520103a22f4f580a28edfbcaa040b48b1bf2e35","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:40.432Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:40.432Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"SeekStorm: sub-millisecond, native vector & lexical search - in-process library & multi-tenancy server, in Rust.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SeekStorm/SeekStorm/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"c2290bce42a9150bbb02893de520103a22f4f580a28edfbcaa040b48b1bf2e35","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SeekStorm/SeekStorm/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:40.434Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T12:56:27Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SeekStorm/SeekStorm/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T02:50:04.492Z","hash":"ae3b71d1c0715f42fb8922f37c383c2d4c2b90b02ee79c300e9f3d8746ce3d5d","originalBytes":81386,"storedBytes":81386,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:40.323Z","subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Apple","MCP servers & agents"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://deephn.org/","attem